<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · river</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ipiranga River</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Ipiranga is a small river, or stream, in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sao-paulo">São Paulo</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brazil">Brazil</a>. On its banks Prince Pedro made the declaration of independence from Portugal in 1822, known as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/grito-do-ipiranga">Grito do Ipiranga</a>. The site is therefore associated with the foundation of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/brazilian-empire">Brazilian Empire</a>.</p></div>
